{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","亡月蚀界"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Moonveil Manifest"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","造成范围伤害并召唤“暗月仪式”，对敌方施加负面效果。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Thador deals AoE damage and performs the Moonveil Rite, inflicting debuffs on affected enemies."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","原地盾击地面，对2格范围内敌人造成320% + 30% ATK伤害，并在范围内召唤“暗月仪式”，持续12秒，其中的敌人降低40点暴击耐性。当“暗月仪式”内所有敌人共累计受到1500%自身初始攻击力的伤害时，范围内每名敌人将受到队伍攻击力160%的伤害，并为全体友军恢复总伤害量80%的生命值，该效果每次召唤“暗月仪式”时至多触发一次。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Thador slams the ground with his shield, dealing 320% + 30% ATK damage to enemies within 2 tiles and conjuring a ritual zone for the Moonveil Rite. The ritual zone lasts for 12s and reduces the Crit DMG DEF of enemies within by 40. When enemies have accumulated damage totaling 1500% of Thador's initial ATK while inside the zone, he unleashes a shadow eruption, dealing 160% of Team ATK damage to each enemy inside the zone. Each ally is then healed for 80% of the eruption's total damage dealt. The eruption can trigger once per Moonveil Rite."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":113,"end":118,"tooltip_key":"keyword:teamatk"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":49,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":379,"end":387,"tooltip_key":"keyword:teamatk"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","满足条件时，区域内所有敌人受到的伤害提升至队伍攻击力170%。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage dealt by the eruption to 170% of the Team ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"keyword:teamatk"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":54,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"keyword:teamatk"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","满足条件时，区域内所有敌人受到的伤害提升至队伍攻击力180%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage dealt by the eruption to 180% of the Team ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"keyword:teamatk"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":54,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"keyword:teamatk"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","满足条件时，区域内所有敌人受到的伤害提升至队伍攻击力190%。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage dealt by the eruption to 190% of the Team ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"keyword:teamatk"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":54,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"keyword:teamatk"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","满足条件时，区域内所有敌人受到的伤害提升至队伍攻击力200%。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases damage dealt by the eruption to 200% of the Team ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"keyword:teamatk"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":54,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"keyword:teamatk"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","暗誓同御"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Darkmoon Pact"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","为副手提供暴击。主动释放时使自身和副手获得护盾。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Thador designates an ally as his lieutenant, increasing their Crit. When casting this skill, Thador grants a shield to both himself and his lieutenant."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","备战时，选择身后一格的友军作为副手，自身存活时，副手获得15 + 1.5点暴击。主动释放时，使自身和副手获得可抵御350% + 35% ATK伤害的护盾，持续8秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Passive. During battle preparation, Thador designates the ally placed 1 tile behind him as his lieutenant. While Thador remains alive, his lieutenant gains 15 + 1.5 Crit.\nActive. Thador grants both himself and his lieutenant a shield that absorbs 350% + 35% ATK damage for 8s."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":61,"end":67,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":158,"end":164,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":251,"end":257,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":57,"end":71,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":247,"end":261,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","获得的护盾值提升至360% + 35% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value granted by this skill to 360% + 35% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":56,"end":62,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":52,"end":66,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","获得的护盾值提升至370% + 35% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value granted by this skill to 370% + 35% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":56,"end":62,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/va