riants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身受到伤害降低16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Reduces damage taken by 16% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身受到伤害降低20%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Reduces damage taken by 20% during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","晦月契阵"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Umbral Descent"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","副手首次释放终极技能时，使所有敌人抗性下降并对其造成伤害。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","When Thador's lieutenant casts Ultimate for the first time, Thador deals damage to all enemies and reduces their Phys & Magic DEF."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每场战斗一次，当副手首次释放终极技能时，召唤暗月降临战场，期间每0.5秒对所有敌人造成80% ATK伤害，并使其护甲与魔抗降低55%。6秒后，效果结束并造成520% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When Thador's lieutenant casts Ultimate for the first time, Thador summons the Darkmoon over the battlefield. While active, the Darkmoon deals 80% ATK damage to each enemy every 0.5s and reduces their Phys & Magic DEF by 55%. After 6s, the Darkmoon fades, dealing 520% ATK damage to each enemy. This effect can trigger once per battle."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":78,"end":86,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":143,"end":150,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":264,"end":272,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","效果结束时的伤害提升至540% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage when the effect ends to 540% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":41,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","副手在战斗开始时获得350点能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Grants Thador's lieutenant 350 Energy when a battle starts."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","效果结束时的伤害提升至560% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage when the effect ends to 560% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":41,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","副手存活时，自身持续恢复生命值。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Thador continuously restores his own HP while his lieutenant is alive."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当副手存活时，自身每秒恢复5%最大生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Thador restores 5% of his max HP every second as long as his lieutenant is alive."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","血誓长锋"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Bloodsworn Edge"]]}